# Source upload for `gcloud builds submit` (click-to-deploy builds the image
# inside the Argolis project). Mirrors .dockerignore plus the files the build
# itself needs. Keep .env and everything else out.
#
# gitignore semantics (unlike .dockerignore): a file cannot be re-included if
# its parent directory is excluded, hence the directory is re-included first and
# its other contents excluded again.
*
!app/
!results/
results/*
!results/llm_trace.jsonl
!requirements-runtime.txt
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!cloudbuild.yaml
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
